; load address 0x0840, 4608 bytes. Names and comments are transferred from src/elite (stock English)
; where tools/map_german.py paired the code or data; otherwise sub_ (call target), loc_ (jump target), dat_ (data/variable reference).

; names of addresses in the other binaries
